    "chunk_text": "swa hw\u00e6\u00f0er swa \u00dea andswarode him se H\u00e6lend & him to cw\u00e6\u00f0, Nafast \u00feu \u00e6nige mihte wi\u00f0 me, butan \u00fee sy ufan seald. \u00dea \u00f0ohte Pilatus \u00fe\u00e6t he hine wolde forl\u00e6tan & him feorh forgeofan. Sona swa Iudeas \u00fe\u00e6t ongeaton, \u00fea cw\u00e6don heo \u00fe\u00e6t he n\u00e6re \u00fe\u00e6s caseres freond buton he hine \u00dea ges\u00e6t he on his heahsetle; het him \u00f0a beran w\u00e6ter to & \u00fewoh his handa & cw\u00e6\u00f0 to Iudeum, Wita\u00f0 \u00dea cw\u00e6don hi sona ealle, Sy his blod & his blodes wracu ofer us & ofer ure bearn. B\u00e6don heo him sylfum swi\u00f0e unl\u00e6dlicere bene, swa heo sy\u00f0\u00f0an eall unl\u00e6du & erm\u00f0u begeatan. \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 he Pilatus: Ecce rex uester. Her is eower cyning. Ateo\u00f0 hine swa ge willon. Cw\u00e6don heo, Nim hine & hat hine ahon. \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 he Pilatus, Hw\u00e6t, ic \u00feonne eowerne cyning hate ahon? Cw\u00e6don heo Iudeas, Nabba\u00f0 we \u00e6nigne cyning buton Casere. Ne gemundan heo \u00fea unl\u00e6da \u00fe\u00e6tte Drihten heora cyning beon sceolde, se \u00f0e ealra cyninga cyning is. \u00dea het Pilatus his \u00feegnas \u00fe\u00e6t heo \u00feone H\u00e6lend ahengon & on rode aneglodon. Heo \u00fea genamon hine & gel\u00e6ddon to \u00fe\u00e6re stowe \u00fe\u00e6r heo hine ahon sceoldon, ge he efne sylfa And heo \u00fea hengon hine on \u00f0am clife \u00fee heo heton Golgotha, & twegen scea\u00f0an",
